{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9ed4dd70f2e3b063", "type": "tool_result", "content": "/usr/local/bin/free-search\nfree-search — Free AI search engine powered by OpenCLI\n\nUsage: free-search <query> [options]\n\nOptions:\n  --limit N        Results per source (default: 5)\n  --category CAT   Search category: general, tech, academic, dev, reference, chinese, all (default: all)\n  --source SRC     Search single source only\n  -f, --format FMT Output format: text, json (default: text)\n  --list-sources   List available sources and exit\n  --timeout SEC    Per-source timeout in seconds (default: 10)\n  -h, --help       Show this help\n\nExamples:\n  free-search \"transformer architecture\"\n  free-search \"RLHF\" --category academic --limit 3\n  free-search \"python asyncio\" --source stackoverflow -f json\n  free-search --list-sources", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "f5e50c98-3ac3-4a62-a2f9-aee094fda5d8", "uuid": "3b5aff66-2739-4138-9410-8a0543a935f1", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T09:19:16.288Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "/usr/local/bin/free-search\nfree-search — Free AI search engine powered by OpenCLI\n\nUsage: free-search <query> [options]\n\nOptions:\n  --limit N        Results per source (default: 5)\n  --category CAT   Search category: general, tech, academic, dev, reference, chinese, all (default: all)\n  --source SRC     Search single source only\n  -f, --format FMT Output format: text, json (default: text)\n  --list-sources   List available sources and exit\n  --timeout SEC    Per-source timeout in seconds (default: 10)\n  -h, --help       Show this help\n\nExamples:\n  free-search \"transformer architecture\"\n  free-search \"RLHF\" --category academic --limit 3\n  free-search \"python asyncio\" --source stackoverflow -f json\n  free-search --list-sources", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
